      "description": [
        {
          "text": "<p>This entry represents a group of eukaryotic proteins, including PHD and RING finger domain-containing protein 1\tfrom human and its orthologue from S. pombe. The function of these proteins is unknown.</p>\n\n<p>This entry also includes Autophagy-related protein 36 (also known as Atg35) from Komagataella phaffii, a micropexophagy-specific protein required for efficient micropexophagic apparatus (MIPA) formation but not for general autophagy [[cite:PUB00155135]].</p>",
